{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0811-causal-feature-selection-contextual-multi-armed.md", "equation": "HIE: FI_HIE(x) = Σ_{b=1}^{m_x} (N_b/N)·(P_{w_b}(Y=1) − P_{w*}(Y=1)), with w_b = argmax_{i∈{1..k}} P_{b_i}(Y=1), w* the global winning arm.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9129}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0811-causal-feature-selection-contextual-multi-armed.md", "equation": "HDD: FI_HDD(x) = Σ_b (N_b/N)·D_b(P_{b_1},…,P_{b_k}) − D(P_1,…,P_k), where D_b = Σ_{i,j} (N_{b_i}N_{b_j}/N_b²)·Σ_{v∈{0,1}} P_{b_i}(Y=v)·log(P_{b_i}(Y=v)/P_{b_j}(Y=v)) (pairwise KL over binary outcomes), and the pooled term is the same with bin subscripts dropped.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9129}
