{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0815-graph-neural-network-agent-google-research-football.md", "equation": "DQN: TD Local = Q(s,a;θ) (Eq. 3); TD Target = r + γ·max_{a'} Q(s',a';θ⁻) (Eq. 4); Loss = r + γ·max_{a'} Q(s',a';θ⁻) − Q(s,a;θ) (Eq. 5). (Note: Eq. 5 as printed is the signed TD error; the actual optimized loss is presumably its square/MSE — not stated.)", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9129}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0816-bayesian-logistic-betting-strategy-probability-forecasting.md", "equation": "Capital: K_n = ∏_{i=1}^n (1 + ν_i(x_i − p_i)) (Eq. 1). Kelly fraction: ν_n = (p̂_n − p_n)/(p_n(1−p_n)) = p̂_n/p_n − (1−p̂_n)/(1−p_n) (Eq. 2). Likelihood-ratio form (Eq. 3): K_n = p̂(x_1..x_n)/∏ p_i^{x_i}(1−p_i)^{1−x_i}.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9129}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0816-bayesian-logistic-betting-strategy-probability-forecasting.md", "equation": "Logistic: log(p̂_n/(1−p̂_n)) = log(p_n/(1−p_n)) + θ'c_n (Eq. 5); p̂_n = p_n e^{θ'c_n}/[1 + p_n(e^{θ'c_n}−1)] (Eq. 6); K_n^θ = e^{θ'Σc_i x_i}/∏(1 + p_i(e^{θ'c_i}−1)) (Eq. 7).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9129}
